### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "girl",
    "password": "girl"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de inserção de consulta (liga paciente 1 e medico 1)
POST http://localhost:40000/insertConsulta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "idPaciente": 1,
    "idMedico": 1,
    "data_hora": "2026-07-10 11:00:00",
    "valor": 220.00,
    "status": true,
    "deleted": false
}

### teste de buscar todas as consultas
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllConsulta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getConsultaByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de atualizar a consulta
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateConsulta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "idPaciente": 1,
    "idMedico": 2,
    "data_hora": "2026-07-10 15:30:00",
    "valor": 275.50,
    "status": false,
    "deleted": false
}

### teste de soft delete da consulta
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteConsulta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
